# models/
# Trained model artefacts, checkpoints, and quantised weights.
# Large binary files should be stored in cloud storage (GCS / S3) and referenced here.
#
# Naming convention:
#   {task}_{language}_{base_model}_{date}/
#   e.g. translate_edo_en_nllb200_2025-01/
